    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "T.\nT. C.\nT. C.\nT. C.\nT. C.\n14\nADJUST\nTOP CENTER\nINTAKE\nCOMPRESSION\n.020\nSTROKE\nADJUST\nEXHAUST\nTININ WASP\n.020\nSHE AROUSTING CO\nNEXT\nSET ON T.C.\nPISTON\nDEPRESS\n10\nTO BE!\nEXHAUST\nDISTRIBUTORI®\nDEPRESS\nINTAKE\nBLOCK\nT. C.\nT. C.\n•y",
      "INSTRUCTIONS\n(1.) Align white pointer\nwith T.C. line of No. 1 cylinder.\n(2) Depress valves indicated by\npointers and release slowly. (3.) Adjust\nvalve clearances indicated by pointers.\n(4.) Align white pointer with T.C. line of\ncylinder indicated in upper window. (5) Re-\npeat procedure until all clearances are ad-\njusted. (6.) Lower window gives the distributor\nblock number\nfor cylinder to\nwhich white\narrow is pointing.\nTWIN\nWASP\nVALVE ADJUSTING GUIDE\nSPENDABLE\nENGINES\nPRATT \u0026 WHITNEY AIRCRAFT\nDIVISION OF\nUNITED AIRCRAFT CORPORATION\nEAST HARTFORD, CONN., U.S. A.\nOMITEHEAD - HO4D HEWARA"
    ],
